<li><a href="biche.html">IV The Hind of Ceryneia</a> 	Scorpio 	<img src="scorpio.gif"> Conjunction
<li><a href="stymphal.html">V  The Birds of Lake Stymphalus</a> 	Sagittarius <img src="sagit.gif"> Putrefaction
<li><a href="crete.html">VI  The Cretan Bull</a> 		Capricorn 	<img src="capric1.gif"> Congealing
<li><a href="cavales.html">VII The Mares of Diomedes</a> 	Aquarius 	<img src="aquarius.gif"> Digestion
<li><a href="amazone.html">VIII The Belt of the Amazon</a> 	Pisces 	<img src="pisces.gif"> Sublimation
